title: "The sharp finite deadline in the 547/727 prime race"
abstract: "The exact finite deadline, its first amplitude discontinuity and the sharp amplitude for factor 18 follow from prime arithmetic. The predecessor also gives a large-height obstruction under Dirichlet GRH."
